# AI-native SDLC Rules

- Classify diff before writing code: `python3 scripts/lane.py --paths <files>`
- Ensure tests fail on base and pass on head: `python3 skills/verify-and-evals/scripts/redgreen.py`
- Populate PR descriptions with required lane evidence (`## Intent`, `## Trace`, `## Review notes`).
- Never bypass pre-push checks or commit broken symlinks.
